# Copy to .env.local and fill in once the Supabase project exists.
# Until then the app runs on the bundled local menu seed, and auth uses the
# local fallback credentials (username: admin / password: vinovino).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Auth setup (when Supabase is configured) ---
# 1. Create the project at supabase.com and copy the URL + anon key above.
# 2. Authentication → Providers → Email: enable; turn OFF "Allow new users to
#    sign up" so only staff accounts you create can log in.
# 3. Authentication → Users → Add user, e.g. email: admin@vinovino.app
#    The login screen takes a username; it maps to <username>@vinovino.app.
